  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index is the top-level discovery surface for the complete Werewolf prototype package.",
    "It binds runtime models, fixtures, tests, and promotion metadata while keeping their authority boundaries separate.",
    "Prototype fixtures and tests are never published as runtime package content.",
    "Blocked capabilities remain explicit and cannot be inferred as supported.",
    "Promotion creates new package artifacts rather than mutating or directly copying prototype authority.",
    "Chronicle owns discovery, recursive contract validation, package isolation, diagnostics, fingerprints, and promotion boundaries.",
    "The Rule Set package owns the declared mechanical model and the evidence required to promote it."
  ]
